@base_url = http://localhost:4004

### Login — joao.silva (ESTOQUE)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "joao.silva",
    "password": "pass-01"
}

###

### GET /auth/me (substitua <TOKEN> pelo token retornado acima)
GET {{base_url}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Logout
POST {{base_url}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Login failure — senha errada (esperado 401)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "joao.silva",
    "password": "senha-errada"
}

###

### Login — admin (ADMIN)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "pass-01"
}

###

### Login — usuário inativo (esperado 401)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "maria.santos",
    "password": "pass-01"
}
